        "heading": "Cut: pay for this one",
        "text": "<p>Cut is the angles and proportions of the stone. It decides how much light comes back out of the top, which is what you see as sparkle.</p><p>A well-cut stone looks brighter than a bigger stone cut badly. Aim for an Excellent or Very Good cut grade before you spend on anything else.</p>"
