        "image_position": "left",
        "min_height": 520,
        "background": "cream",
        "heading": "Colour: G to H is the sweet spot",
        "text": "<p>Colour runs from D (no colour) to Z (yellow or brown tint). The less colour, the higher the grade and the price.</p><p>Once a stone is set, most people cannot tell G or H from D. That is where the value sits.</p>"
      }
