        "background": "sand",
        "heading": "Clarity: eye-clean is enough",
        "text": "<p>Clarity grades count the natural marks inside the stone, from Flawless down to Included.</p><p>Marks at VS and many SI grades are invisible without a loupe. Choose a stone that is clean to the eye rather than paying for a grade you will never see.</p>"
